# Never ship secrets or private data in the image (patterns match at any depth).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/data/private/
**/private-data/
**/uploads/
**/.local/
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# Not needed at runtime.
.git
**/node_modules
.claude
docs/reviews/
**/*.log
